+| `LONG_WAY` | ours |  |  | one of the two ways joists run; `grep -rn 'joists_span' crates/`: nothing |
+| `read` | ours |  |  | the words typed for the way joists run (`JoistsSpan::read`); `grep -rn 'fn read' crates/core/src/timber.rs`: nothing |
